OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDense fog for many during the
OL,6,Fmorning, and cold too with some frost
OL,7,Fpatches. Coastal showers may be heavy
OL,8,Fat times, and the best bright or sunny
OL,9,Fspells will be further inland. Feeling
OL,10,Fcool, but pleasant autumn sunshine is
OL,11,Favailable.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe odd coastal shower will
OL,14,Fremain. Otherwise dry with long clear
OL,15,Fspells under which temperatures will
OL,16,Fsharply fall. Cold with a touch of
OL,17,Ffrost, and fog developing inland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
