OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA pleasant autumnal day with
OL,6,Flong spells of sunshine, after morning
OL,7,Ffog lifts. Still rather chilly,
OL,8,Fespecially as a brisk coastal breeze
OL,9,Farrives in the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,12,Ffoggy, frosty and bright morning on
OL,13,FMonday, before cloud thickens. Cloudy
OL,14,Fand breezy with spells of rain during
OL,15,FTuesday and Wednesday, but
OL,16,Ftemperatures will be milder than
OL,17,Fprevious days.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
